Files: packaging/licenses/watchfiles-rust-crates/*--*
Copyright: See the corresponding original per-crate notice file.
Comment: Original license and copyright texts for the selected watchfiles 1.3.0 wheel and its 26 compiled Cargo crates.
 The adjacent watchfiles-rust-crates.source.json records each crate version,
 registry checksum, manifest license expression, original notice path,
 copied notice SHA-256, and size.
License: see-included-original-notice
 The complete original license and copyright text is retained in the
 corresponding file in packaging/licenses/watchfiles-rust-crates/.
 The source JSON maps each copied file to the exact crate archive and source
 path reviewed. The included texts cover the package's MIT license and the
 crate notices identified as MIT, Apache-2.0, ISC, Unicode-DFS-2016, Unlicense,
 Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, and CC0-1.0 in that metadata.

